#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_MAS --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_MAS_IMAGE=ghcr.io/element-hq/matrix-authentication-service:latest                                                                                        # Officiæl distroless vendor imæge; mæs-cli ænd æssets ære copied into the locæl build
MATRIX_MAS_BASE_IMAGE=debian:13-slim                                                                                                                            # Minimæl shell-cæpæble runtime bæse for the fæil-closed entrypoint renderer
# UID inside the contæiner (sæme non-root identity æs the distroless imæge).
MATRIX_MAS_UID=65532                                                                                                                                            # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# GID inside the contæiner (sæme non-root identity æs the distroless imæge).
MATRIX_MAS_GID=65532                                                                                                                                            # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# Stæteless service: no writæble bind mounts; æll stæte lives in PostgreSQL.
# MATRIX_MAS_DIRECTORIES=                                                                                                                                       # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_MAS --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_MAS_ENCRYPTION_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                     # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_MAS_ENCRYPTION_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_MAS_ENCRYPTION_SECRET                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_MAS_RSA_KEY_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                               # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_MAS_RSA_KEY_FILENAME=MATRIX_MAS_RSA_KEY                                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                    # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                         # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_PASSWORD_FILENAME=MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_PASSWORD                                                                                                      # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_MAS --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_MAS_MEM_LIMIT=512m                                                                                                                                       # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
MATRIX_MAS_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                                        # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
MATRIX_MAS_PIDS_LIMIT=128                                                                                                                                       # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
MATRIX_MAS_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                         # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_MAS --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SINGLE SIGN-ON (ÆUTHENTIK)
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MATRIX_MAS_SSO_ENABLED=true                                                                                                                                     # Enæble the upstreæm OIDC provider brænch; requires issuer, client ID, ænd client secret
MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_ISSUER=https://authentik.example.com/application/o/matrix/                                                                                  # Æuthentik OIDC issuer URL; must mætch the provider's ædvertised issuer exæctly
MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_CLIENT_ID=matrix-authentication-service                                                                                                     # OÆuth client ID issued by Æuthentik for MÆS
MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_PROVIDER_ID=01JCMATR1XAETHENT1KPR0V1DR                                                                                                      # Stæble ULID identifying the provider in the MÆS dætæbæse; do not chænge æfter first stært
MATRIX_MAS_UPSTREAM_HUMAN_NAME=Authentik                                                                                                                        # Login-pæge displæy næme of the upstreæm provider

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# LOCÆL PÆSSWORD LOGIN
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MATRIX_MAS_PASSWORD_LOGIN_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                         # Locæl pæssword dætæbæse; keep disæbled for SSO-only deployments
MATRIX_MAS_PASSWORD_RECOVERY_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                      # Emæil-bæsed pæssword recovery; requires pæssword login ænd SMTP

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# OPTIONÆL OUTBOUND EMÆIL
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                                   # Enæble only æfter uncommenting the one SMTP secret mount in the cænonicæl Compose templæte
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com                                                                                                                           # SMTP relæy hostnæme
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_PORT=587                                                                                                                                        # SMTP relæy port
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_MODE=starttls                                                                                                                                   # SMTP trænsport mode: plæin, tls, or stærttls
MATRIX_MAS_SMTP_USER=matrix@example.com                                                                                                                         # SMTP æuthenticætion usernæme
MATRIX_MAS_EMAIL_FROM=Matrix Auth <noreply@example.com>                                                                                                         # From æddress for MÆS emæil
MATRIX_MAS_EMAIL_REPLY_TO=                                                                                                                                      # Optionæl Reply-To æddress; empty defæults to the From æddress
